OTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 시험장소 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 본교/시험일 하루 전 학교홈페이지 공지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 응시료 보증금 : 4,000원 (대구통학버스 신청시 10,000원)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 시험 신청자들의 응시율을 높이고 사업의 효율성을 제고하기 위하&nbsp; 여 응시료 보증금&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;“선예치&nbsp;후반환” 제도를 도입 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;- 시험 응시료 보증금은 4,000원, 대구통학버스 신청자는 보증금 10,000원으로 함 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 응시료 보증금은 시험 응시 후 응시자 계좌로 입금 조치함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt\">- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt\">시험 미응시할 경우 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt\">응시료 보증금은 시험 신청자 명의로 학교발전기금으로 납부함 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">- 응시료는 시험 신청 후 1일 이내로 아래 계좌로 입금해야 함-미입금시 승인안됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">농협 301-0070-7584-01 예금주 : 금오공과대학교</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">입금 시에는 ‘모의 및 학번 뒷번호 여섯 자리’ 를 반드시 명시(예 : 모의091234</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> )</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HE